<title>USA: Kroger Co Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Kroger Co Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 $0.95		    $0.81</p>
<p> Net			 125,519		  105,499</p>
<p> Revs		    6,199,156		5,860,734</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 $2.65		    $2.38</p>
<p> Net			 349,873		  302,813</p>
<p> Revs		   25,170,909	     23,937,795</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Primary shr is same as diluted for Q4. Primary shr is $2.66 vs $2.52 for year.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 net includes charge for early extinguishment of debt of $0.03 per primary and diluted shr.</p>
<p>Year 1995 net includes charge for early extinguishment of debt of $0.13 per primary shr and $0.12 per diluted shr.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 oper shr, excluding charge is $0.84 primary and diluted.</p>
<p>Year 1995 oper shr, excluding charge is $2.65 primary and $2.50 diluted.</p>
</text>
